sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Cliente
    participant P as Proxy/CDN
    participant S as Security Middleware
    participant R as Router NestJS
    participant G as Guards
    participant I as Interceptors
    participant Pi as Pipes
    participant H as Handler
    participant SR as Service
    participant RP as Repository
    participant DB as Database

    C->>P: HTTP Request
    P->>S: Trusted Proxy
    S->>S: Compression
    S->>S: Request Limits
    S->>S: Security Headers
    S->>S: Helmet (CSP, HSTS)
    S->>S: CORS
    S->>S: Rate Limiting
    S->>R: Request
    R->>G: Guards
    G->>I: Interceptors
    I->>Pi: Pipes (validación)
    Pi->>H: Handler
    H->>SR: Service
    SR->>RP: Repository Interface
    RP->>DB: Prisma Query
    DB-->>RP: Result
    RP-->>SR: Domain Entity
    SR-->>H: Response
    H-->>I: Return
    I-->>I: ResponseFormatInterceptor
    I-->>I: ExecutionTimeInterceptor
    I-->>I: ApiVersionInterceptor
    I-->>C: HTTP Response
